	(text "R-bank, 5VSB rail -- LADDER v1.1 [wb]: 3 groups (1+1+2 legs, 4 total, 3R3 each) x AOD4184A+3557-10 fuse+local AND gate driver, shared Kelvin shunt + INA181/TLV7011 trip-watch per rail; CEC_CONN harness-boundary connector"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 20.32 0)
		(effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.35) (bold yes) (color 26 95 180 1)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "58e8201c-fcfe-4cac-aa1e-c63f01e2edb8")
	)
	(text "5VSB R-bank, LADDER v1.1 [wb] (README.md, pending owner nod): 3 groups, 1+1+2 legs (4 total @ 3R3 each), ST-1000 baseline drawn -- the ST-1300 population variant (12V group - +12 legs, 16->28) is a population-only BOM extension, not physically drawn this pass (\"never in copper\" per README -- deferred, see the pin-audit addendum). Fuse UPSTREAM of FET (DESIGN-SHEET C.12). Trip-watch is PER-RAIL (one shared Kelvin shunt in the common FET-source return), not per-group -- matches 03-mcu's committed 1-bit TRIP_BANK budget; per-group ATOF fusing is the real per-leg protection. Harness-boundary CEC_CONN_1x8: pins 1-6 real, rest spare."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 378.46 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (color 21 96 61 1)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "adb5aec3-b2f4-4e1b-840f-f5db15650b55")
	)
